# Class-only accounting. Named external talents/traditions are manual records, not automated sphere mechanics.
Conscript	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:FavoredClass	VISIBLE:DISPLAY	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_LEVEL,1	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Favored Class Bonus|SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_LEVEL	DESC:Conscript favored class; use the existing hit-point or skill-rank rewards. No racial reward catalog is added.
Conscript Combat Training	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresInternal.SpheresCombatTraining	VISIBLE:NO	DEFINE:SPHERES_COMBAT_TALENTS|0	DEFINE:SPHERES_PRACTITIONER_MOD|0	DEFINE:SPHERES_PRACTITIONER_DC|0	DEFINE:SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS|0	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_COMBAT_TALENTS|SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_LEVEL+floor((SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_LEVEL+1)/2)	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_PRACTITIONER_DC|10+floor(SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_LEVEL/2)+SPHERES_PRACTITIONER_MOD	DESC:Expert combat training. Choose a mental practitioner ability, three additional class skills, and optionally record a first-level martial tradition. External talent prerequisites and effects are adjudicated manually.	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Spheres Martial Focus
Intelligence Practitioner	CATEGORY:Conscript Practitioner Ability	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_LEVEL,1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_PRACTITIONER_MOD|INT
Wisdom Practitioner	CATEGORY:Conscript Practitioner Ability	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_LEVEL,1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_PRACTITIONER_MOD|WIS
Charisma Practitioner	CATEGORY:Conscript Practitioner Ability	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_LEVEL,1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_PRACTITIONER_MOD|CHA
Conscript Additional Class Skill	CATEGORY:Conscript Class Skill	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_LEVEL,1	MULT:YES	STACK:NO	CHOOSE:SKILL|!CLASS	CSKILL:LIST	DESC:Chosen additional class skill: %1.|%LIST
Combat Talent (Manual)	CATEGORY:Spheres Combat Talent	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_LEVEL,1	MULT:YES	STACK:YES	CHOOSE:USERINPUT|1|TITLE=Combat sphere or talent name	DESC:Manual combat talent record: %1. Costs one talent; external prerequisites and effects are not automated.|%LIST
Martial Tradition (Manual)	CATEGORY:Conscript Martial Tradition	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_LEVEL,1	MULT:YES	STACK:NO	CHOOSE:USERINPUT|1|TITLE=Martial tradition and its granted talents	DESC:First-character-level tradition record: %1. Record its grants here; they do not spend class talents. External effects and tradition restrictions are manual.|%LIST	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Spheres Martial Focus
Extra Combat Talent	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:General.Combat	MULT:YES	STACK:YES	CHOOSE:NOCHOICE	DEFINE:SPHERES_COMBAT_TALENTS|0	DEFINE:SPHERES_PRACTITIONER_MOD|0	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_COMBAT_TALENTS|1	DESC:Gain one additional combat talent per selection.	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Spheres Martial Focus
Conscript Bonus Feats	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresInternal	VISIBLE:NO	DEFINE:SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_BONUS_FEATS|0	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_BONUS_FEATS|if(SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS>=5,0,1+floor(SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_LEVEL/2)-if(SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS>=1,1+floor(SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_LEVEL/10),0)-if(SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS>=2,if(SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_LEVEL>=6,1,0)+if(SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_LEVEL>=14,1,0),0)-if(SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS>=3,if(SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_LEVEL>=2,1,0)+if(SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_LEVEL>=18,1,0),0)-if(SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS>=4,if(SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_LEVEL>=8,1,0)+if(SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_LEVEL>=16,1,0),0))
# Unlike Incanter there is no separate activation purchase: powers unlock at their stated class levels.
Conscript Gear Training	CATEGORY:Conscript Specialization	COST:1	PREVAREQ:SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_LEVEL,1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS|1	ABILITY:Internal|AUTOMATIC|Weapon Prof ~ Martial|Armor Prof ~ Medium|Shield Prof	ABILITY:Internal|AUTOMATIC|Armor Prof ~ Heavy|Shield Prof ~ Tower|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_LEVEL,6
Conscript Indomitable Will	CATEGORY:Conscript Specialization	COST:1	PREVAREQ:SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_LEVEL,1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS|1	BONUS:SAVE|BASE.Will|2+floor(SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_LEVEL/2)-floor(SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_LEVEL/3)
Conscript Evasion	CATEGORY:Conscript Specialization	COST:1	PREVAREQ:SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_LEVEL,1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS|1	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Evasion|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_LEVEL,3	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Improved Evasion|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_LEVEL,10
Conscript Fast Movement	CATEGORY:Conscript Specialization	COST:2	PREVAREQ:SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_LEVEL,1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS|2	DEFINE:SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_SPEED|0	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_SPEED|if(SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_LEVEL<3,0,10*(1+floor((SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_LEVEL-1)/5)))	BONUS:MOVEADD|TYPE=Walk|SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_SPEED|PREVARLT:ENCUMBERANCE,2,var("COUNT[EQTYPE.ARMOR.EQUIPPED.IS.HEAVY]"),1
Conscript Banner	CATEGORY:Conscript Specialization	COST:1	PREVAREQ:SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_LEVEL,1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS|1	DEFINE:SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_BANNER|0	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_BANNER|if(SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_LEVEL<2,0,1+floor((SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_LEVEL-2)/4))	DESC:Visible banner: allies within 60 feet gain +%1 morale against fear and on charge attacks. Situational; not a permanent bonus to the conscript.|SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_BANNER
Conscript Inspiration	CATEGORY:Conscript Specialization	COST:1	PREVAREQ:SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_LEVEL,1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS|1	DEFINE:SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_INSPIRATION|0	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_INSPIRATION|floor(SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_LEVEL/2)	DESC:Daily inspiration uses: %1; add 1d6 to a skill or ability check for one use, or attack/save for two. Begins at level 2.|SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_INSPIRATION
Conscript Armor Training	CATEGORY:Conscript Specialization	COST:1	PREVAREQ:SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_LEVEL,1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS|1	DEFINE:SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_ARMOR|0	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_ARMOR|if(SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_LEVEL<3,0,1+floor((SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_LEVEL-2)/4))	BONUS:MISC|MAXDEX|SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_ARMOR|PREEQUIP:1,TYPE=Armor	BONUS:MISC|ACCHECK|SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_ARMOR|PREEQUIP:1,TYPE=Armor	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Conscript Medium Armor Movement|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_LEVEL,3	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Conscript Heavy Armor Movement|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_LEVEL,8
Conscript Medium Armor Movement	CATEGORY:Special Ability	UNENCUMBEREDMOVE:MediumArmor
Conscript Heavy Armor Movement	CATEGORY:Special Ability	UNENCUMBEREDMOVE:HeavyArmor
Conscript Resolve	CATEGORY:Conscript Specialization	COST:1	PREVAREQ:SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_LEVEL,1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS|1	DEFINE:SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_RESOLVE|0	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_RESOLVE|floor((SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_LEVEL+1)/2)	DESC:Resolve: %1 uses/day. Defeating an enemy restores one use up to the maximum. Spend a use to suppress specified conditions, roll twice on Fortitude/Will, or stabilize and remain conscious below zero HP. Expanded conditions at level 8; adjudicate triggers and actions manually.|SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_RESOLVE
Conscript Sneak Attack	CATEGORY:Conscript Specialization	COST:2	PREVAREQ:SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_LEVEL,1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS|2	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Sneak Attack|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_LEVEL,3	BONUS:VAR|SneakAttackDice|floor(SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_LEVEL/3)
Conscript Studied Target	CATEGORY:Conscript Specialization	COST:2	PREVAREQ:SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_LEVEL,1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS|2	DEFINE:SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_STUDIED|0	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_STUDIED|1+floor(SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_LEVEL/8)	DESC:Study as a move action (also swift from level 10). Maintain %1 targets; +%1 on attacks, damage, relevant skills and conscript/sphere DCs against those targets only. With sneak attack specialization, study a sneak-attacked target as an immediate action. Target-specific bonuses are not permanent global bonuses.|SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_STUDIED
Sphere Specialization (Manual)	CATEGORY:Conscript Specialization	COST:3	PREVAREQ:SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_LEVEL,1	MULT:YES	STACK:NO	CHOOSE:USERINPUT|1|TITLE=Specialized combat sphere	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS|3	DESC:Chosen sphere: %1. Record its free sphere (or replacement talent) here, not in the paid pool. Effective Conscript BAB/HD +1 for that sphere only. Its level 3/8/20 powers and sphere effects are manual; this does not raise global BAB.|%LIST
Delayed Sphere Specialization (Manual)	CATEGORY:Conscript Delayed Sphere	PREVAREQ:SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_LEVEL,1	MULT:YES	STACK:NO	CHOOSE:USERINPUT|1|TITLE=Additional specialized combat sphere	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_COMBAT_TALENTS|-1-floor((SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_LEVEL-1)/4)	DESC:Additional sphere: %1. Forfeit bonus talents at levels 1/5/9/13/17. Free sphere and sphere-only +1 effective BAB/HD begin at level 2; first powers at 4 and 9, capstone at 20. Record grants here; sphere mechanics are manual.|%LIST
